.\" ###### Setup ############################################################
.Dd October 13, 2026
.Dt get-system-info 1
.Os get-system-info
.\" ###### Name #############################################################
.Sh NAME
.Nm get-system-info
.Nd obtains system information
.\" ###### Synopsis #########################################################
.\" Manpage syntax help:
.\" https://forums.freebsd.org/threads/howto-create-a-manpage-from-scratch.13200/
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm get-system-info
.Op Fl c Ar version | Fl Fl compatibility Ar version
.br
.Op Fl A | Fl Fl all
.Op Fl a | Fl Fl none
.br
.Op Fl B | Fl Fl with-battery
.Op Fl b | Fl Fl without-battery
.br
.Op Fl E | Fl Fl with-os
.Op Fl e | Fl Fl without-os
.br
.Op Fl F | Fl Fl with-ssh
.Op Fl f | Fl Fl without-ssh
.br
.Op Fl K | Fl Fl with-kernel
.Op Fl k | Fl Fl without-kernel
.br
.Op Fl L | Fl Fl with-load
.Op Fl l | Fl Fl without-load
.br
.Op Fl M | Fl Fl with-memory
.Op Fl m | Fl Fl without-memory
.br
.Op Fl N | Fl Fl with-network
.Op Fl n | Fl Fl without-network
.br
.Op Fl O | Fl Fl with-hostname
.Op Fl o | Fl Fl without-hostname
.br
.Op Fl S | Fl Fl with-storage
.Op Fl s | Fl Fl without-storage
.br
.Op Fl T | Fl Fl with-uptime
.Op Fl t | Fl Fl without-uptime
.br
.Op Fl U | Fl Fl with-user
.Op Fl u | Fl Fl without-user
.Nm get-system-info
.Op Fl h | Fl Fl help
.Nm get-system-info
.Op Fl v | Fl Fl version
.\" ###### Description ######################################################
.Sh DESCRIPTION
get-system-info obtains system information in machine\-readable form. It is
mainly intended for being used by
.Xr System\-Info 1 .
.\" ###### Arguments ########################################################
.Sh ARGUMENTS
The following options are available:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl c Ar version | Fl Fl compatibility Ar version
Request a certain version for the output. This option is to allow for future
changes of get\-system\-info. Currently, the only available version is 0.
.It Fl A | Fl Fl all
Query all system information (default).
.It Fl a | Fl Fl none
Do not query any system information.
.It Fl B | Fl Fl with-battery
Enable query of battery information.
.It Fl b | Fl Fl without-battery
Disable query of battery information.
.It Fl E | Fl Fl with-os
Enable query of operating system release information.
.It Fl e | Fl Fl without-os
Disable query of operating system release information.
.It Fl F | Fl Fl with-ssh
Enable query of SSH host key fingerprint information.
.It Fl f | Fl Fl without-ssh
Disable query of SSH host key fingerprint information.
.It Fl K | Fl Fl with-kernel
Enable query of kernel information.
.It Fl k | Fl Fl without-kernel
Disable query of kernel information.
.It Fl L | Fl Fl with-load
Enable query of system load and process information.
.It Fl l | Fl Fl without-load
Disable query of system load and process information.
.It Fl M | Fl Fl with-memory
Enable query of system memory and swap information.
.It Fl m | Fl Fl without-memory
Disable query of system memory and swap information.
.It Fl N | Fl Fl with-network
Enable query of network interface information.
.It Fl n | Fl Fl without-network
Disable query of network interface information.
.It Fl O | Fl Fl with-hostname
Enable query of hostname information.
.It Fl o | Fl Fl without-hostname
Disable query of hostname information.
.It Fl S | Fl Fl with-storage
Enable query of storage and disk usage information.
.It Fl s | Fl Fl without-storage
Disable query of storage and disk usage information.
.It Fl T | Fl Fl with-uptime
Enable query of system uptime information.
.It Fl t | Fl Fl without-uptime
Disable query of system uptime information.
.It Fl U | Fl Fl with-user
Enable query of user information.
.It Fl u | Fl Fl without-user
Disable query of user information.
.It Fl h | Fl Fl help
Prints the program's command\-line parameters and exits.
.It Fl v | Fl Fl version
Prints the program version and exits.
.El
.\" ###### Exit status ######################################################
.Sh EXIT STATUS
The
.Nm
tool exits with 0 on success, and >0 in case of an error.
.\" ###### Examples #########################################################
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It get-system-info
.It get-system-info -a -O -T -U
.It get-system-info --none --with-memory --with-load
.It get-system-info --without-battery
.It LANGUAGE=de_AT get-system-info
.It LANGUAGE=nb get-system-info
.It get-system-info \-\-version
.El
